            For most homes, the Midea Cube 35 is the quiet dehumidifier to buy: Sylvane lists a maximum of 48 dB, it has the capacity to dry a living room or finished lower level on low, and its large tank lasts the night. LG's Sonoran has the lowest published figure at 40 dB if you want an app and accept an unexplained number, Levoit's smart unit adds a pump that ends bucket alarms, and for single rooms the Midea Cube 20 is quiet on low.
